+        // screen shows while YOUR_SAVED_INFO_SETTINGS_PAGE_ANDROID is on. The flag is
+        // disabled by default and only the field trial testing config turned it on, so
+        // a release build with disable_fieldtrial_testing_config takes this older path
+        // instead and the row came back, permanently reading "Stopped working on this
